WEBVTT

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:06.980
<b>This program is a work of fiction. The characters, organizations, locations, cases, etc. being portrayed are unrelated to actual events.</b>

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.400
It wasn't...

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.740
Please don't move. Help will be here soon.

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:20.450
It wasn't... R-Ryang-Ha...

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:27.080
He wanted to negotiate with me.

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:35.590
Sell me Ryang-Ha Song, please.

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:42.140
It's my fault that my mother

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:46.010
and the people around me 
are being threatened.

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:53.070
Everything about me is hazy, for some reason.

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:55.600
I don't understand.

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:07.590
And yet, even though I shouldn't 
know the first thing about you,

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:11.960
you're so seared into my mind 
 that it makes me sick.

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:25.940
If only I weren't here...

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:34.720
That won't do.

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:41.080
It won't do for me.

00:01:57.210 --> 00:01:57.970
I'm sorry.

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:45.060
You'll be all right now.

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:49.770
Okay?

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:52.350
Please don't cry.

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:57.880
Can you tell me your name?

00:03:07.110 --> 00:03:09.330
Mine's Ryang-Ha.

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:14.530
Ryang-Ha Song.

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:19.960
Please...

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:25.040
Could you tell me your name?

00:04:57.890 --> 00:05:00.030
Heave-ho...

00:05:00.470 --> 00:05:01.590
Heave-ho...

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:04.530
Heave-ho...

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:06.720
Heave-ho...

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:21.570
There we go.

00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:35.270
Mr. Ritzland!

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:37.520
Mr. Ritzland!

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:39.930
Mr. Ritzland!

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:46.430
Contact his wife!

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:47.190
Right away!

00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:52.740
The boss?!

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:54.600
Wow!

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:56.770
Yes.

00:05:56.770 --> 00:05:59.120
We can't speak to him yet.

00:05:59.530 --> 00:06:01.400
But don't worry.

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:03.140
He's recovering so quickly,

00:06:03.140 --> 00:06:05.100
<i>even the doctors are surprised.</i>

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:08.390
In any case, that's cause for celebration.

00:06:08.390 --> 00:06:11.840
Now we can head to 
Port Barosela without worry.

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:15.400
<i>The police are at the hospital, as well.</i>

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:19.380
<i>Please stay there, ma'am, 
for your own safety.</i>

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:21.040
Understood.

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:22.640
You take care, too.

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:27.220
<i>Chateau aside, we haven't heard anything</i>

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:30.170
<i>from José and Cedran since 
the call last night, either.</i>

00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:32.700
<i>Hopefully we can meet them at Barosela.</i>

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:14.820
What's this?

00:07:14.820 --> 00:07:16.550
Are you by yourself?

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:20.000
Where's Miss Chateau?

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:22.890
She completed her delivery.

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:25.250
That's why I'm here.

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:28.340
That fulfills the transaction, does it not?

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:56.410
Chateau Noble.

00:07:57.400 --> 00:08:00.310
Chateau, huh?

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:10.180
Chateau, I don't know if you'll 
believe me, but I'm on your side.

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:14.680
I'm going to take you somewhere safe.

00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:17.430
I promise.

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:27.070
What a crowd.

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:31.630
Let's see... There should be 
someone here to pick us up.

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:34.150
Don't get lost, okay?

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:39.890
I bought that dress and 
set up a date for nothing.

00:08:46.010 --> 00:08:47.540
This is really bad.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:49.500
Has anyone called the police?

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.210
Are you all right?

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.040
Hey! Hey!

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:58.180
<i>I've taken care of the 
car headed to Barosela.</i>

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:01.270
Well done, Tom.

00:09:01.960 --> 00:09:04.440
<i>What do we do about Ritzland?</i>

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:08.330
Shall I go to the hospital and deal with him?

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:12.780
<i>No, I've already made 
sufficient arrangements.</i>

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:14.850
Leave him.

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:17.030
More importantly...

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:19.910
<i>Jinon has caught his target.</i>

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:23.160
<i>He's also rendezvoused with Nikka.</i>

00:09:24.740 --> 00:09:27.040
<i>I've prepared to invite them to my residence.</i>

00:09:28.430 --> 00:09:31.760
<i>I'd like to ask you to 
find Chateau Dankworth.</i>

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:34.440
<i>Continue on to the port.</i>

00:09:35.110 --> 00:09:35.980
Understood.

00:09:46.260 --> 00:09:47.820
Raise your arms.

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:49.700
Okay, good.

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:52.860
Lower them.

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:55.060
All good.

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:58.110
Shall we get in the car, then?

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:00.840
I'm surprised, though.

00:10:00.840 --> 00:10:03.290
You really showed up unarmed.

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:06.780
You haven't swallowed a 
gun or anything, have you?

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:11.010
Jinon, would you mind driving?

00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:13.800
Why, Nikka?

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:17.840
I want to have a chat with our guest.

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:18.930
That cool?

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:20.440
Hmm.

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:37.190
Not a smoker?

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:40.560
You aren't even friendly.

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:44.580
Come on, just chat with me.

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:49.580
I have some questions for you.

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:54.360
Our chief insists on meeting you personally.

00:10:54.360 --> 00:10:58.130
He even wants us to bring you to him alive.

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:01.590
It's the biggest pain in the ass ever.

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:04.600
You got any idea what that's all about?

00:11:05.810 --> 00:11:07.150
Beats me.

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:12.620
I can think of a long list of reasons, 
but I don't know the exact one.

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:14.860
<i>You finally opened your mouth.</i>

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:21.190
Besides, I haven't even been 
told what your chief's name is.

00:11:23.220 --> 00:11:24.240
Who is it?

00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:32.310
Donald Bachmann.

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:35.750
We call him Donny.

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:39.010
Well?

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:42.760
Does that narrow your long list down for you?

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:47.260
Well, gee...

00:11:47.650 --> 00:11:49.260
I've never heard of him.

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:52.140
You're messing with me.

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:56.450
Really?

00:11:57.180 --> 00:11:59.360
You can't be serious.

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:02.360
Honestly...

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:05.650
Nikka?

00:12:05.650 --> 00:12:07.160
Don't bullshit me.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:08.260
What are you doing?

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:12.370
Why is Donny so interested in you?

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:14.550
Ryang-Ha Song...

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:18.310
Just who are you?

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:05.660
Sheesh.

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:07.640
Give it a rest, Nikka.

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:09.950
He's not resisting.

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:10.890
Right?

00:13:13.860 --> 00:13:16.450
Not resisting, huh?

00:13:17.490 --> 00:13:21.000
That's not who you are, is it?

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:26.990
I heard you made quite a 
splash with the Santoukai.

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:31.890
It only took you three years to take down 
an organization tens of thousands strong.

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:34.250
That's not easy.

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:38.000
I've heard a lot about your 
accomplishments back then...

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:40.500
from a late coworker of yours.

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:43.000
You know who I'm talking about, don't you?

00:13:50.790 --> 00:13:52.140
Where is she?

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:55.020
Is she that precious to you?

00:13:57.140 --> 00:14:00.310
So what are you scheming this time?

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:02.280
Do you think you're going to charm my boss

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:05.650
and destroy us from the inside
 like you did the Santoukai?

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:08.630
Nikka, cut it out already.

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:12.990
Jeez.

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:15.430
What an unfair accusation.

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:17.270
I just told you.

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:19.250
I have no idea what you're talking about.

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:26.730
I have no interest in either 
your organization or Donny.

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:30.070
I'm only coming along 
because I have no choice.

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:33.760
At the very least...

00:14:34.840 --> 00:14:37.640
you should really watch your mouth.

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:42.770
Nikka, let go of him, please.

00:14:43.390 --> 00:14:46.400
I was the one who brought him.

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:50.660
Don't mess with my prey.

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:16.100
My bad, Jinon.

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:18.560
I won't do any more.

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:20.850
Put that away, would you?

00:15:25.960 --> 00:15:29.280
We weren't exactly raised very well.

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:33.060
It's hard for us to back 
down once we get fired up.

00:15:33.060 --> 00:15:35.200
Keep that in mind.

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:37.860
Come on, use it.

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:40.510
I don't want the car getting dirty.

00:15:40.510 --> 00:15:43.180
This is my car, you know.

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:54.650
<i>I was going to shoot him if 
he dodged or blocked me.</i>

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:56.810
<i>He let me hit him on purpose.</i>

00:15:56.810 --> 00:15:57.720
<i>In fact...</i>

00:15:58.340 --> 00:16:01.290
<i>I was aiming for his temple
 from his blind spot,</i>

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:03.730
<i>and he turned to take it with his forehead.</i>

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:08.100
<i>No ordinary person could 
think or act so quickly.</i>

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:10.860
<i>He's got experience.</i>

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:16.080
Chateau.

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:17.530
Chateau!

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:24.300
Jim?

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:26.640
Yeah.

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.510
Why...

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:31.130
I'll explain later.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:33.330
We're in danger of being attacked.

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:36.450
We have to escape, quickly!

00:16:51.260 --> 00:16:52.670
Oh, yeah.

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:57.780
Once we get out of the car, 
you're wearing these and a blindfold.

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:00.620
Thanks for being a good sport.

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:05.370
I'm not into this kind of thing, 
just so you know.

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:07.630
Don't just ignore me.

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:09.460
You're supposed to quip back.

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:11.360
You're embarrassing me.

00:17:14.480 --> 00:17:16.170
Damn it, dude...

00:17:16.170 --> 00:17:18.140
You don't know how to play along, do you?

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:27.700
The boat will leave port by evening.

00:17:27.700 --> 00:17:30.220
Let's hurry through the 
procedure to disembark.

00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:32.760
I'm all right.

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:34.610
I can walk.

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:38.810
Jim, your head...

00:17:39.230 --> 00:17:40.490
Oh, this?

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:44.120
I was attacked on my way here.

00:17:44.420 --> 00:17:48.700
It was a close call, but I was 
lucky he aimed for my head.

00:17:57.680 --> 00:18:01.180
He must have thought he got me.

00:18:01.550 --> 00:18:03.950
He took off right away.

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:07.390
It was a blessing in disguise.

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:10.940
<i>I should play dead for a while.</i>

00:18:11.970 --> 00:18:15.820
I can't get in contact with José and Cedran.

00:18:16.220 --> 00:18:19.570
Their location tracking cut off at sea.

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:25.130
We're lucky your phone GPS responded.

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:28.790
Thanks to that,
 I was able to find you quickly.

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:32.340
Chateau...

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:35.280
What happened?

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:48.950
Jim...

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:50.100
Yes?

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:52.110
Hide.

00:18:56.610 --> 00:18:57.060
Cha—

00:18:57.060 --> 00:18:57.770
Stop.

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:03.160
Are you Chateau Dankworth?

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:06.910
I heard you talking. 
I know someone's with you.

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:08.410
Come out!

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:11.450
Your business is with me, is it not?

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:14.240
Are you with Jinon Wong?

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:17.890
You're well-informed.

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:21.220
Thank you for making this 
transaction go more quickly.

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:23.720
Quickly?

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:29.100
Ryang-Ha Song has been handed over.

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:32.110
What?

00:19:32.110 --> 00:19:35.150
He's so tame that it's 
almost throwing them off.

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:39.360
People sure do become docile 
when they have a weakness.

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:44.470
Sorry, but you're going to be 
sticking with me a while longer.

00:20:20.560 --> 00:20:22.280
Jim, are you all right?

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:24.370
I'm fine.

00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:27.750
This guy in the biker jacket...

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:29.980
He's the one who attacked me.

00:20:31.450 --> 00:20:34.590
We've made a lot of noise, though.

00:20:34.590 --> 00:20:38.170
We're lucky not many people 
are around while we're docked.

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:40.300
Still, how do we explain this?

00:20:43.370 --> 00:20:46.090
I'll take care of the rest for you.

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:46.890
Okay?

00:20:47.960 --> 00:20:49.500
Is something the matter?

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:51.930
I'll explain.

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:55.200
We're a little busy here right now.

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:56.890
Stay clear.

00:20:56.890 --> 00:20:58.460
Huh? What do you mean?

00:20:58.460 --> 00:21:02.440
Um... Oh, it might explode and stuff.

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:03.660
What?! A terror attack?!

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:05.450
Yeah, yeah! Something like that!

00:21:35.740 --> 00:21:37.060
Come in.

00:21:48.930 --> 00:21:50.530
Welcome,

00:21:51.260 --> 00:21:53.430
Ryang-Ha Song.

00:23:36.700 --> 00:23:40.020
Next episode: "A War Trigger."
